{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"edf8f0e49d846a8e","type":"group","x":1200,"y":-440,"width":2640,"height":2480,"label":"2. PP设计核心"},
		{"id":"4a3096c0c60811d2","type":"group","x":-1280,"y":-440,"width":2200,"height":2480,"label":"1. 问题由来"},
		{"id":"84938c4d19774205","type":"text","text":"训练深层 Transformer模型","x":-360,"y":-420,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5e1e278072752ebd","type":"text","text":"单 GPU 保存所有 Block","x":-360,"y":-299,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6980b8681487f2a3","type":"text","text":"参数、梯度、优化器状态及激活占用显存；计算负担大","x":-360,"y":-179,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e673f388c22b7d9f","type":"text","text":"TP：把Transformer中Block内部Linear层的权重矩阵分给多个GPU同时运算","x":-735,"y":407,"width":250,"height":153},
		{"id":"b702549931ad9bea","type":"text","text":"FSDP/HSDP：把模型的权重、梯度、优化器状态分散存储在多张GPU，需要计算时，临时恢复收集它们权重","x":620,"y":407,"width":250,"height":160},
		{"id":"f65dfee46b0cf956","type":"text","text":"PP：把Transformer中的多个Block分别放置在不同的GPU中","x":-48,"y":417,"width":288,"height":133},
		{"id":"1f059a4c09098639","type":"text","text":"单 GPU 显存容量或计算吞吐成为瓶颈","x":-360,"y":-59,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9e7f27fa0e082ccc","type":"text","text":"SwiGLU MLP 的 3 个权重矩阵（Wgate、Wup、Wdown）","x":-610,"y":680,"width":250,"height":83},
		{"id":"468b1063dce023dc","type":"text","text":"聚焦 PP：Transformer 由多个顺序连接的 Block 构成","x":-48,"y":693,"width":288,"height":60},
		{"id":"75651eb75f92a72c","type":"text","text":"DP/DDP：复制整个模型到多张GPU，每张GPU分别训练不同的数据样本","x":-1160,"y":400,"width":250,"height":160},
		{"id":"973ddb8125bd7499","type":"text","text":"不同维度的并行解决思路","x":-360,"y":61,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8a7a9ced02873f32","type":"text","text":"Attention 的 4 个权重矩阵（Wq、Wk、Wv、Wo）","x":-860,"y":683,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"6ad57d4067742f5a","type":"text","text":"将连续 Block 分组，形成多个 Pipeline Stage","x":-48,"y":1000,"width":288,"height":60},
		{"id":"f03de359732c6733","type":"text","text":"每个 Stage 保存并计算其负责的网络层","x":-48,"y":1140,"width":288,"height":80},
		{"id":"298a4326a073453f","type":"text","text":"Stage 间存在数据依赖：Forward 顺序传递激活，Backward 反向传递梯度","x":-48,"y":1260,"width":288,"height":100},
		{"id":"9583eaf33c9147cc","type":"text","text":"若整个 Batch 顺序通过各 Stage，会产生 GPU 空闲等待","x":-48,"y":1440,"width":288,"height":100},
		{"id":"6dcb7cd0d050a768","type":"text","text":"按网络深度将不同 Block 分配给不同 GPU","x":-48,"y":840,"width":288,"height":60},
		{"id":"014c98c826d11353","type":"text","text":"通过 GPipe / 1F1B 等调度重叠不同 Stage 的计算","x":-48,"y":1740,"width":288,"height":80},
		{"id":"d14d80ecd5003061","type":"text","text":"将 Batch 拆成多个 Micro-batch","x":-48,"y":1600,"width":288,"height":60},
		{"id":"1d154b092055c84e","type":"text","text":"设计一：Stage 划分","x":1760,"y":387,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f422b18e159313bb","type":"text","text":"按网络深度将连续 Block 分配给不同 Stage","x":1760,"y":507,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e279872d69b026b4","type":"text","text":"单个训练Batch划分为多个Micro-batch","x":2072,"y":507,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"36c0bd23e881734a","type":"text","text":"设计二：Micro-batch 划分","x":2072,"y":387,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6dce1409f2ed6b1a","type":"text","text":"PP核心：将Transformer模型分层，并让不同的Micro-batch在不同Stage重叠执行","x":2395,"y":67,"width":250,"height":134},
		{"id":"379247ec590309b4","type":"text","text":"全部Micro-batch的梯度先累积；必要时完成 DP 同步","x":3055,"y":627,"width":250,"height":127},
		{"id":"418d16a2900c0742","type":"text","text":"纯PP不需要在不同Stage间All-Reduce同一权重梯度","x":2395,"y":820,"width":250,"height":122},
		{"id":"3c5fbf3591ccfdf9","type":"text","text":"Inter-leaved/Zero-Bubble/Dual-Piple：进一步降低等待或隐藏通信","x":2715,"y":820,"width":250,"height":122},
		{"id":"5683cc9081ab3067","type":"text","text":"需要的同步完成后，各Stage更新自己管理的参数","x":3055,"y":820,"width":250,"height":113},
		{"id":"15d3ca9e8608ecbe","type":"text","text":"设计五：梯度累积与参数更新","x":3055,"y":387,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"989df00375344a79","type":"text","text":"各 Stage 保存并计算各自的模型层，Stage 0 持有W1，Stage 1持有W2","x":1760,"y":627,"width":250,"height":113},
		{"id":"d4661176f7a55e18","type":"text","text":"Stage间有前后依赖，Stage内按照正常顺序运行，同一 Micro-batch 按 Stage 顺序执行","x":1760,"y":820,"width":250,"height":122},
		{"id":"0ddfced3662d135a","type":"text","text":"每个Micro-batch仍需通过全部Stage","x":2072,"y":627,"width":250,"height":113},
		{"id":"d987e53bdc422102","type":"text","text":"设计三：跨Stage通信","x":2395,"y":387,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e9f867ff026dae56","type":"text","text":"不同 Stage 之间存在数据依赖","x":2395,"y":507,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"015e9b0e8b8ec34d","type":"text","text":"forward：Send/Recv 隐藏状态 H；backward：Send/Recv 隐藏状态的梯度dH","x":2395,"y":627,"width":250,"height":113},
		{"id":"442fa956ea9dc526","type":"text","text":"设计四：调度策略","x":2715,"y":387,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"54d72c502ababda6","type":"text","text":"GiPipe：先全部forward，在全部backward","x":2715,"y":507,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"40b8c6407f566b47","type":"text","text":"不同Stage可同时处理不同Micro-batch","x":2072,"y":820,"width":250,"height":122},
		{"id":"7033e19b2fb893a8","type":"text","text":"提高设备利用率，但仍可能存在 Pipeline Bubble","x":-48,"y":1900,"width":288,"height":80},
		{"id":"8f0161c7383f6663","type":"text","text":"各 Stage 计算本地参数梯度","x":3055,"y":507,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"29d0883810995673","type":"text","text":"1F1B：稳态交替安排forward和backward；1F1B：Warmup、Steady、Cooldown","x":2715,"y":627,"width":250,"height":113},
		{"id":"db4747aa2c33cf46","type":"text","text":"训练前准备","x":-2880,"y":2420,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4d8c8c35e9de14d5","type":"text","text":"按模型深度划分 Pipeline Stage","x":-2880,"y":2540,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"af9d25d972d1cce0","type":"text","text":"每个Stage放置在不同GPU（或GPU组）上","x":-2880,"y":2680,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bb80f802e1083e5d","type":"text","text":"Stage 1：Block 5 ~ Block 8","x":-2630,"y":2824,"width":250,"height":60},
